      "message": "fix(verify): name a cut deeper than the flute length first (WIP)\n\nHeld work: four pinned warning lists move (mcp_verify,\nshoulder_adaptive, strategy_fallback, tool_body_beside_shank).\ntool_body_beside_shank shows that the wider-shank block refuses a\nprogram that verifies clean. Waits for a decision.\n\nRefs #3525\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>",
